 "html": "<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(48px,7vw,96px);padding-bottom:clamp(48px,6vw,80px)\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:#4C4A66\"><a href=\"/\" style=\"color:#4C4A66\">Home</a><span>/</span><a href=\"/stablecoins\" style=\"color:#4C4A66\">Stablecoins</a><span>/</span><span style=\"color:#3B2ED3\">Stablecoin off-ramp API</span></nav><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(34px, 2.2vw + 26px, 58px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.045em;font-weight:700;margin:28px 0 0;max-width:16ch\">Stablecoin off-ramp API for Africa<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:.2em;height:.2em;margin-left:.06em;background:#FFB224\"></span></h1><p style=\"font-size:clamp(17px,1.4vw,19px);line-height:1.55;color:#4C4A66;margin:24px 0 0;max-width:58ch\">Convert USDC and USDT into local currency and deliver it to mobile money wallets and bank accounts in 20 African countries. For wallets, exchanges, fintechs and treasury teams.</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:32px\"><a href=\"/contact\" style=\"padding:16px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;background:#3B2ED3;color:#fff\" class=\"dp-1uxoczp\">Talk to sales</a><a href=\"/#platform\" style=\"padding:16px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;background:#F6F4EF;color:#131126\" class=\"dp-1u9awz2\">See the platform →</a></div><div style=\"margin-top:40px;max-width:760px;padding:22px 24px;border-radius:20px;background:#F6F4EF\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#4C4A66\"><span style=\"width:8px;height:8px;background:#5ED6B4\"></span>In short</div><p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-size:16px;li